      "force: FPVI0.Set(FI, -1.0, FPVIe_1V, FPVIe_2A, FPVIe_RELAY_ON) for TM601 (DERIVED sign, not the DFT literal, because PGND sits on FPVIe0's HIGH terminal; three-step chain and U11 criteria are in the code comments)",
      "clamp: FPVI0.SetClamp(50, 50) issued after the FV/FI mode switch and re-issued after every switch; provisional engineering default, protection only, never a pass/fail criterion",
      "pulse: delay_ms(1) settle then MeasureVI(200, 5, FPVIe_MV_X10) then IMMEDIATE Set(FI, 0, ...); settle 1 ms + acquisition 1 ms = 2 ms <= the 2 ms HARD CAP on the whole forced-current duration; the three other delays (delay_ms(3) x2, delay_ms(5)) are annotated as outside the pulse window",
      "arithmetic: R[mOhm] = measured MVRET / fabs(measured MIRET) * 1e3 (R-VIR: measured over measured; the programmed 1 A is never substituted)",
